# Current theses

## Thesis T-migrated-internal-cli: Preserve reviewed project guidance
Status: accepted
Based-on: user-reviewed-contract-migration

### Guidance
<folder_context path="internal/cli">
<user_interface_surface name="CLI">
Expose exactly init, add, pull, remove, list plus --help and --version. The dispatcher, help,
completion/docs, tests, and errors contain no old aliases. Exit 0 is success, 1 operational or
partial failure, and 2 invalid invocation/input.
</user_interface_surface>
<function_contract name="init">
Create a minimal schema 2 a2amodule.yml without overwriting either accepted manifest spelling;
add .git-a2a/ to .gitignore. No interview or harness setup. An omitted agent is explicitly
reported as incomplete for publication.
</function_contract>
<function_contract name="add">
add SOURCE accepts optional --name, --ref, and --path. Fetch and validate the upstream schema 2
manifest and required agent, reject self-reference, resolve one commit, choose all applicable
exports/adapters (or submodule fallback), persist variants, apply transactionally, materialize
relative Agent Card and surface, then write the already validated declaration and lock. A
successful add leaves every selected platform dependency usable without a manual install.
</function_contract>
<function_contract name="pull">
pull [NAME] preflights all selected entries, then processes aliases in stable order. Each entry
resolves ref once and calls the saved adapter bindings; missing materialization is restored.
Successful earlier entries may remain if a later entry fails, and the summary must say so.
</function_contract>
<function_contract name="remove">
Remove one dependency through each saved adapter so native declarations, native locks and
project-local materialization converge, then remove its submodule, card snapshot, surface,
cache, declaration, and lock without touching user data or other dependencies.
</function_contract>
<function_contract name="list">
list [NAME] [--json] is offline and read-only. Stable output contains alias, component, source,
requested ref, installed commit, saved adapter/variants, declared and usable agent-card
references with provenance, surface path, and local problems. It performs no Git network,
package-manager operation, or liveness check.
</function_contract>
</folder_context>

### Rationale
Migrated from the pre-2.0 HINT source format without changing its guidance.

